    "00F8A2FC is unidentified. Virtuals used: +38h, +3Ch (status, field +34h vs 4 and 2), +44h, +70h(a, b, 1), +148h(dst, tmp).",
    "00414130, 00683820, 004D6790, 00427190, 004C1E90 and 005803E0 were used but not read.",
    "+19Ch gates the second smoothing branch of 00588C70 and has no writer in this packet.",
    "+1A0h has no clear site in this packet.",
    "0057D3B0 has no Ghidra function; it sits inside the stored body of 0057D0D0 and is the quit-confirm callback. It also holds the page write at 0057D472.",
    "The sound slot names navigate/select/back come from the action grouping, not from a string."
